# Vercel upload rules.
#
# .gitignore protects git history; this protects the deployed artifact.
# Both are needed: a file can be tracked in git and still be uploaded.

# ---- customer data: must never be publicly downloadable ------------
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
*Booking_System*
content-plan.json

# ---- build / tooling scripts ---------------------------------------
*.py
*.ps1
gen_*.py

# ---- article working drafts ----------------------------------------
Aghbala.txt
Amoger.txt
Er-Rich (Rich).txt
Lake Isli.txt
Lake Tislit.txt
Midelt.txt

# ---- local env / secrets -------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
# ---- customer booking cards (contain names, email, phone, travel dates) ---
booking-card*.html
*ABR-*.html

# ---- internal research / notes: never publish ----
RESEARCH-*.md
README.md
translate-all.js
